port = 4444
newSessionWaitTimeout = -1
servlets = []
withoutServlets = []
capabilityMatcher = "org.openqa.grid.internal.utils.DefaultCapabilityMatcher"
throwOnCapabilityNotPresent = true
```

**2. Node Architecture**

Nodes are the workers that actually execute the tests.

```
Node Components:
├── Slot Counter     → Tracks available browser slots
├── Browser Launcher → Starts browser instances
├── Session Cleaner  → Cleans up after tests
├── Health Checker   → Reports status to hub
└── File Publisher   → Handles file transfers
```

